# Opus variant, classifier rename 4 of 5 (see README.md in this
# directory). Part of a matched set with the opus72 transplant in
# transplants.txt here: never apply the renames without it.
name: opus-rename-classifier-mod31
kind: module
module: 31
region: code
address: 0x0307E119
gate: Never apply without the opus72 transplant (patches/opus_swap/
  transplants.txt): the rename routes extension OPU to decoder
  module 72, which holds the WMA library until the transplant
  replaces it. Build refuses unless the 3 stock bytes at the target
  equal expect; the finished image must also pass
  firmware_patch.validate().
rationale: The browser window's own copy of the audio extension
  classifier string MP1MP2MP3WMAWAVAPEFLAAACM4AOGGMP43GPDFFDSF,
  at module 31 code 0x0307E110; the WMA entry sits at string
  offset +9. Renaming it to OPU makes slot 3 match the extension
  the FAT layer's 8.3 alias carries for .opus files, so the
  browser lists and routes Opus files to decoder module 72, and
  .wma files stop matching.
expect: 574d41
replace: 4f5055
